 ⚠ HIGH-RISK SOFTWARE NOTICE — read this before proceeding.

 This software ships with high-risk capabilities: network traffic
 interception (MITM), CA certificate injection, SSL pinning bypass,
 APK repackaging, dynamic instrumentation (Frida / LSPosed), root
 operations and detection hiding, plus an AI agent able to execute
 shell commands autonomously. In the wrong hands it is an attack
 tool, and in most jurisdictions using any of the above against
 devices, apps or networks without explicit authorization is illegal.

